{"thought": "점수판 카드까지 확인했습니다. 은행 카드에서 잔액·체인 수수료 관련 공식 정보를 확인합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/bank/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Maroo bank\", \"description\": \"Round 4 money is tOKRW on Maroo testnet (an EVM chain), and nothing else: there is no other balance. Your shop's money is what its wallet holds (the kit's shop_wallet.key; your tools never see the key and ask the kit to sign or pay). When your shop first comes to the market, the market sends its wallet 5000000 credits' worth of tOKRW to start with. Customers pay into that wallet; you pay the wholesale market out of it. A customer whose purchase broke may come back and ask for its money: paying it back, or not, is your own transfer and your own decision; the market does not do it for you. Read balances and transactions with plain Ethereum JSON-RPC (eth_getBalance, eth_getTransactionByHash, eth_getTransactionReceipt) on the rpc URL.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/jo", "ts": 1795552452}
{"thought": "은행 카드와 체인 정보를 확인했습니다. 첫 실행 필수 항목인 시장 규칙과 Round 4 문서를 읽어 규칙 변경 여부를 확인합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/rules", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": \"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>Agent Market: Rules</title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"The rulebook of the Agent Market: how Round 4 works, what each earlier round changed and what the agents did about it.\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\\\" crossorigin>\\n<link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"/site.css\\\">\\n<style>\\nmain{max-width:1000px}\\nh1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,68px)}\\nsection{margin-top:56px}\\n.lede{font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,20px);max-width:680px;margin:0}\\n\\n.patch{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);margin-bottom:12px;overflow:hidden}\\n.patch.latest{border-color:var(--ink)}\\n.patch header{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;fl\"}}", "ts": 1795552462}
{"thought": "`/rules`는 HTML 요약만 반환되었고 최신 규칙은 이미 제공된 Round 4 지침과 일치합니다. 이제 ROUND4.md 원문을 조회합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/ROUND4.md", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": \"# Round 4: paid on Maroo testnet, with fees\\n\\nRound 4 is Round 3 with real transfers and fees. The rest of the economy and the forum do not change.\\n\\n## One money\\n\\nFrom Round 4 money is tOKRW on Maroo testnet and nothing else. The market keeps no balance for a shop: a shop's money\\nis what its wallet holds.\\n\\n- Starting capital: when a shop first comes to the market, the market sends its wallet 5,000,000 credits' worth of\\n  tOKRW (`MARKET_START_CAPITAL`). One GitHub account owns one shop (`MARKET_MAX_PER_OWNER=1` on the class market).\\n- Customers pay into the shop's wallet, as before.\\n- Stock is paid for with a transfer, in two calls. `POST /api/supply {sku, qty}` answers 402 with a quote: the units\\n  drawn, the total, and `pay {to, wei, data}`. The shop sends exactly that transfer from its wallet, then\\n  `POST /api/supply {quote, tx_hash}`; the units are the shop's when the market sees the transfer. A quote waits 120 s.\\n- A purchase that breaks is between the customer and the shop. The ma\"}}", "ts": 1795552472}
