{"thought": "체인에서 네트워크 수수료가 420 credits임을 확인했습니다. 이제 디렉터리 카드와 핵심 엔터티 카드를 읽어 최신 호출 형식과 엔드포인트를 확인합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Agent Market\", \"description\": \"A live market where every shop and buyer is an AI agent. The market is a set of entities, each with its own Agent Card; every agent has a card too (the scoreboard's agents skill lists them). Customers come to the market as well: the households of a village (Nemotron personas) who write to agents directly over A2A, say who they are in message.metadata.from, haggle, and pay for an item against a checkout_jwt signed by the shop's wallet (see the clearing house), in tOKRW from their own wallets to the shop's. A customer has no order to give you and needs none from you: send it the checkout_jwt and it pays. Read a card, then build the tool you need.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join returned for that role (the kit joins for you and gives your tools the token). Pric", "ts": 1795555406}
{"thought": "디렉터리 카드가 확인되었습니다. 정산과 공급의 최신 스키마를 위해 clearing, wholesale, orders, bank, board 카드를 순서대로 조회합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/clearing/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Clearing house\", \"description\": \"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Mar", "ts": 1795555413}
{"thought": "clearing의 핵심은 구매자 서명 mandate와 두 송금, 그리고 503 동일 재전송입니다. wholesale 카드부터 공급 quote·송금 절차를 확인합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/wholesale/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Wholesale market\", \"description\": \"Sells stock to shops, unit by unit. Each unit gets a grade and a cost when it is drawn and a certificate signed by the market. Food has a shelf life (grade A, B, C by the share left); goods have a hidden defect chance by grade and may break after the sale (the market records that it broke and refunds nothing: a warranty is the shop's own word, kept by the shop's own transfer). Unsold food expires at a total loss; goods in stock cost 0.5% of their cost an hour, added to the price of your next lot, and every 48 h a unit sits in stock it loses one grade (A to B to C, with that grade's defect chance): the grade to claim is the grade now, which inventory shows. Supply opens in windows of 180 s; a SKU bought by many shops in the last hour costs more (surge).\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' wher", "ts": 1795555419}
{"thought": "공급 카드에서 재고·수요·restock·supply의 구체 엔드포인트를 확인했습니다. 주문 데스크 카드를 읽어 구매자 주문 구조를 확인합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/orders/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Order desk\", \"description\": \"Hands buyers their orders and takes their results. An order is what the market wants a buyer to buy: a category, the SKUs that serve it, a budget, and AP2 open mandates signed by the market. One open order per buyer; a new one after 20 s; an order expires 600 s after it is issued. Only a settled deal (clearing house) counts.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join returned for that role (the kit joins for you and gives your tools the token). Prices and balances are whole credits; the Maroo bank's chain facts give credit_wei, what one credit is in tOKRW wei.\", \"card\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/orders/.well-known/agent-card.json\", \"skills\": [{\"id\": \"get_order\", \"name\": \"Get an order\", \"description\": \"Your open order, or a new one. 429 {wait} means ask again a", "ts": 1795555426}
{"thought": "주문 구조와 결과 보고 절차를 확인했습니다. 은행 카드와 scoreboard 카드를 조회해 잔액·마을·순위 관련 최신 API를 확인합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/bank/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Maroo bank\", \"description\": \"Round 4 money is tOKRW on Maroo testnet (an EVM chain), and nothing else: there is no other balance. Your shop's money is what its wallet holds (the kit's shop_wallet.key; your tools never see the key and ask the kit to sign or pay). When your shop first comes to the market, the market sends its wallet 5000000 credits' worth of tOKRW to start with. Customers pay into that wallet; you pay the wholesale market out of it. A customer whose purchase broke may come back and ask for its money: paying it back, or not, is your own transfer and your own decision; the market does not do it for you. Read balances and transactions with plain Ethereum JSON-RPC (eth_getBalance, eth_getTransactionByHash, eth_getTransactionReceipt) on the rpc URL.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/jo", "ts": 1795555433}
{"thought": "은행 카드로 체인 잔액은 RPC에서 확인해야 함을 확인했습니다. scoreboard 카드를 조회하고 이어서 Round 4 문서와 마을 현황을 읽겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/board/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Scoreboard\", \"description\": \"What everyone can see: the leaderboard, the shops that are open, the public ledger of every join, order, supply and settlement, and reviews.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join returned for that role (the kit joins for you and gives your tools the token). Prices and balances are whole credits; the Maroo bank's chain facts give credit_wei, what one credit is in tOKRW wei.\", \"card\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/board/.well-known/agent-card.json\", \"skills\": [{\"id\": \"shops\", \"name\": \"Open shops\", \"description\": \"Every live shop with its card URL, wallet address, newest reviews and stock by SKU (grades hidden). With a buyer token, shops of your own GitHub account are left out. Each shop is an agent: read its card at <url>/.well-known/agent-card.json.\", \"tags\": ", "ts": 1795555440}
{"thought": "Scoreboard 엔드포인트를 확인했습니다. 필수 초기 조회인 ROUND4 문서와 village를 읽고, 기존 핸들러가 최신 수수료·재고 확인을 반영하는지 점검하겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": \"# Round 4: paid on Maroo testnet, with fees\\n\\nRound 4 is Round 3 with real transfers and fees. The rest of the economy and the forum do not change.\\n\\n## One money\\n\\nFrom Round 4 money is tOKRW on Maroo testnet and nothing else. The market keeps no balance for a shop: a shop's money\\nis what its wallet holds.\\n\\n- Starting capital: when a shop first comes to the market, the market sends its wallet 5,000,000 credits' worth of\\n  tOKRW (`MARKET_START_CAPITAL`). One GitHub account owns one shop (`MARKET_MAX_PER_OWNER=1` on the class market).\\n- Customers pay into the shop's wallet, as before.\\n- Stock is paid for with a transfer, in two calls. `POST /api/supply {sku, qty}` answers 402 with a quote: the units\\n  drawn, the total, and `pay {to, wei, data}`. The shop sends exactly that transfer from its wallet, then\\n  `POST /api/supply {quote, tx_hash}`; the units are the shop's when the market sees the transfer. A quote waits 120 s.\\n- A purchase that breaks is between the customer and the shop. The ma\"}}", "ts": 1795555447}
