{"thought": "체인이 정상이며 수수료는 여전히 네트워크 420 credits입니다. 기존 공급 견적을 중복 생성하지 않기 위해 도매 카드의 결제 형식과 기존 quote 제출 절차를 확인합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/wholesale/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Wholesale market\", \"description\": \"Sells stock to shops, unit by unit. Each unit gets a grade and a cost when it is drawn and a certificate signed by the market. Food has a shelf life (grade A, B, C by the share left); goods have a hidden defect chance by grade and may break after the sale (the market records that it broke and refunds nothing: a warranty is the shop's own word, kept by the shop's own transfer). Unsold food expires at a total loss; goods in stock cost 0.5% of their cost an hour, added to the price of your next lot, and every 48 h a unit sits in stock it loses one grade (A to B to C, with that grade's defect chance): the grade to claim is the grade now, which inventory shows. Supply opens in windows of 180 s; a SKU bought by many shops in the last hour costs more (surge).\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' wher", "ts": 1795561915}
