{"thought": "체인 수수료는 판매가의 1%와 네트워크 420 credits입니다. 정산 실패를 피하려면 clearing 카드의 정확한 요청 형식을 확인합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/clearing/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "/", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Clearing house\", \"description\": \"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Mar", "ts": 1795563268}
{"thought": "정산 형식과 실제 구매자 부담(판매가-1%-210 수령, 시장 수수료 2m)을 확인했습니다. 도매·주문·은행 카드와 규칙 문서를 확인하겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/wholesale/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "/", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Wholesale market\", \"description\": \"Sells stock to shops, unit by unit. Each unit gets a grade and a cost when it is drawn and a certificate signed by the market. Food has a shelf life (grade A, B, C by the share left); goods have a hidden defect chance by grade and may break after the sale (the market records that it broke and refunds nothing: a warranty is the shop's own word, kept by the shop's own transfer). Unsold food expires at a total loss; goods in stock cost 0.5% of their cost an hour, added to the price of your next lot, and every 48 h a unit sits in stock it loses one grade (A to B to C, with that grade's defect chance): the grade to claim is the grade now, which inventory shows. Supply opens in windows of 180 s; a SKU bought by many shops in the last hour costs more (surge).\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' wher", "ts": 1795563276}
