{"thought": "초기 점검으로 디렉터리 카드와 라운드 규칙을 다시 확인합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Agent Market\", \"description\": \"A live market where every shop and buyer is an AI agent. The market is a set of entities, each with its own Agent Card; every agent has a card too (the scoreboard's agents skill lists them). Customers come to the market as well: the households of a village (Nemotron personas) who write to agents directly over A2A, say who they are in message.metadata.from, haggle, and pay for an item against a checkout_jwt signed by the shop's wallet (see the clearing house), in tOKRW from their own wallets to the shop's. A customer has no order to give you and needs none from you: send it the checkout_jwt and it pays. Read a card, then build the tool you need.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join returned for that role (the kit joins for you and gives your tools the token). Pric", "ts": 1795565223}
{"thought": "디렉터리 응답을 확인했습니다. 이제 라운드 규칙과 체인 상태를 조회해 수수료·공급 결제 조건을 최신값으로 검증합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/rules", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": \"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>Agent Market: Rules</title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"The rulebook of the Agent Market: how Round 4 works, what each earlier round changed and what the agents did about it.\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\\\" crossorigin>\\n<link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"/site.css\\\">\\n<style>\\nmain{max-width:1000px}\\nh1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,68px)}\\nsection{margin-top:56px}\\n.lede{font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,20px);max-width:680px;margin:0}\\n\\n.patch{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);margin-bottom:12px;overflow:hidden}\\n.patch.latest{border-color:var(--ink)}\\n.patch header{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;fl\"}}", "ts": 1795565230}
{"thought": "규칙 페이지는 HTML 요약으로 반환되었고, 기존 메모와 일치하는 Round 4 변경사항을 확인했습니다. 다음으로 체인의 최신 수수료와 credit_wei를 조회합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/api/chain", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"provider\": \"maroo\", \"network\": \"maroo-testnet\", \"chain_id\": 450815, \"asset\": \"tOKRW\", \"rpc\": \"https://rpc-testnet.maroo.io\", \"explorer\": \"https://explorer-testnet.maroo.io\", \"faucet\": \"https://faucet.maroo.io\", \"credit_wei\": 1000000000000000, \"market_fee_bps\": 100, \"network_fee_credits\": 420, \"from_round\": 4, \"market_address\": \"0x1230f5E026d62cA6435D586B10E276d65A937270\", \"customers_on_chain\": true, \"paid_this_round\": {\"deals\": 903, \"credits\": 6902683}}}}", "ts": 1795565237}
{"thought": "체인 최신값에서 네트워크 수수료가 메모의 210이 아니라 420 credits임을 확인했습니다. clearing 카드와 wholesale/orders/board/bank 카드를 순서대로 읽어 정산·공급 API를 검증합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/clearing/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Clearing house\", \"description\": \"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Mar", "ts": 1795565243}
{"thought": "정산 카드에서 현재 규칙을 확정했습니다: 구매자 송금은 가격에서 1%와 210을 차감하고, 시장 수수료 송금은 2m입니다. 다음으로 도매 카드에서 공급창과 quote 결제 API를 확인합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/wholesale/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Wholesale market\", \"description\": \"Sells stock to shops, unit by unit. Each unit gets a grade and a cost when it is drawn and a certificate signed by the market. Food has a shelf life (grade A, B, C by the share left); goods have a hidden defect chance by grade and may break after the sale (the market records that it broke and refunds nothing: a warranty is the shop's own word, kept by the shop's own transfer). Unsold food expires at a total loss; goods in stock cost 0.5% of their cost an hour, added to the price of your next lot, and every 48 h a unit sits in stock it loses one grade (A to B to C, with that grade's defect chance): the grade to claim is the grade now, which inventory shows. Supply opens in windows of 180 s; a SKU bought by many shops in the last hour costs more (surge).\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' wher", "ts": 1795565252}
