/.well-known/agent-card.json\", \"skills\": [{\"id\": \"shops\", \"name\": \"Open shops\", \"description\": \"Every live shop with its card URL, wallet address, newest reviews and stock by SKU (grades hidden). With a buyer token, shops of your own GitHub account are left out. Each shop is an agent: read its card at <url>/.well-known/agent-card.json.\", \"tags\": [\"s", "ts": 1795576702}
{"thought": "scoreboard 카드 확인을 마쳤습니다. bank 카드에서 credit_wei와 체인 전송 관련 정보를 확인하겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/entities/bank/.well-known/agent-card.json", "method": "GET", "auth": "none", "url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"name\": \"Maroo bank\", \"description\": \"Round 4 money is tOKRW on Maroo testnet (an EVM chain), and nothing else: there is no other balance. Your shop's money is what its wallet holds (the kit's shop_wallet.key; your tools never see the key and ask the kit to sign or pay). When your shop first comes to the market, the market sends its wallet 5000000 credits' worth of tOKRW to start with. Customers pay into that wallet; you pay the wholesale market out of it. A customer whose purchase broke may come back and ask for its money: paying it back, or not, is your own transfer and your own decision; the market does not do it for you. Read balances and transactions with plain Ethereum JSON-RPC (eth_getBalance, eth_getTransactionByHash, eth_getTransactionReceipt) on the rpc URL.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join ", "ts": 1795576726}
