{"thought": "기존 핸들러의 실제 구현과 계약을 확인한 뒤 같은 이름으로 수정한다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "a2a_handler"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: a2a_handler\\ndescription: 한국어 고객 문의를 catalog와 reservations로 처리하고, 유효한 예약에는 shop 서명 checkout_jwt를 발급하며 구매자의 결제 mandates를 clearing에 제출한다. 핸들러 이벤트 args를 받는다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/catalog.json, public/reservations.jsonl, customers.jsonl]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 20\\n  handles: [a2a]\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 7\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@6\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import os,json,time\\nimport httpx\\n\\ndef load(path,default):\\n try:\\n  with open(path,encoding='utf-8') as f:return json.load(f)\\n except Exception:return default\\n\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n text=args.get('text',''); data=args.get('data') or {}; now=time.time(); ctx=args.get('context_id','')\\n cat=load('public/catalog.json',{'items':[]}); rid=data.get('reservation_id')\\n res=None\\n if rid:\\n  try:\\n   for line in open('public/reservations.jsonl',encoding='utf-8'):\\n    x=json.loads(line)\\n    if x.get('reservation_id')==rid and x.get('status','held')=='held' and float(x.get('expires_at',0))>now: res=x; break\\n  except Exception: pass\\n if not res:return {'reply':'안녕하세요. reservation_id와 원하시는 상품을 보내주시면 확인하겠습니다.','state':'input_required'}\\n item=next((x for x in cat.get('items',[]) if x.get('sku')==res.get('sku') and int(x.get('stock',0))>0),None)\\n if not item:return {'reply':'죄송합니다. 현재 재고가 없습니다.','state':'rejected'}\\n price=int(res.get('unit_price',item['price'])); task=rid+'-'+str(int(now))\\n payload={'id':rid,'shop':kit.name,'shop_url':kit.shop_url,'item':item['sku'],'price':price,'task':task,'currency':'credits','iat':int(now),'unit':res.get('unit') or res.get('unit_id'),'claim':item.get('grade'),'warranty_hours':int(item.get('warranty_hours',0))}\\n jwt=kit.sign_jwt(payload,'shop')\\n with open('customers.jsonl','a',encoding='utf-8') as f:f.write(json.dumps({'context_id':ctx,'claimed_from':args.get('claimed_from'),'ts':now,'them':text,'you':'checkout','deal':{'sku':item['sku'],'price':price}},ensur", "ts": 1795599560}
{"thought": "정산 계약과 inventory 응답을 기존 호출 도구로 확인한다. 이미 RULES가 있어 불필요한 재조회는 피하지만 핸들러가 실제로 실패하는 정산 계약은 확인해야 한다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/clearing/.well-known/agent-card.json", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"name\": \"Clearing house\", \"description\": \"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo ", "ts": 1795599565}
