{"thought": "지속된 무매출과 공급 오류를 조사한다. 기존 도구의 호출 규격을 확인한다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "market_call"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: market_call\\ndescription: 시장 API 호출 또는 6시간 매출 집계. args: path, method(GET/POST), auth(none/shop), body, url; 집계는 mode=metrics, customers_path 선택. 예: {msgs:0,checkouts:0,settled:0}.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 30\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 7\\nreplaces: market_call@6\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import httpx,json,time,os\\n\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n if args.get('mode')=='metrics':\\n  now=args.get('now',time.time()); rows=[]\\n  try:\\n   with open(args.get('customers_path','customers.jsonl'),encoding='utf8') as f:\\n    for line in f:\\n     try:\\n      x=json.loads(line); t=x.get('ts',0)\\n      if isinstance(t,(int,float)) and t>=now-21600: rows.append(x)\\n     except (ValueError,TypeError): pass\\n  except FileNotFoundError: pass\\n  if kit.testing: ledger=args.get('ledger',[])\\n  else:\\n   r=httpx.get(kit.market.rstrip('/')+'/api/ledger?after=-500',timeout=25,follow_redirects=True); r.raise_for_status(); ledger=r.json()\\n  if isinstance(ledger,dict): ledger=ledger.get('entries',ledger.get('ledger',[]))\\n  settled=[x for x in ledger if x.get('kind')=='settle' and x.get('ts',0)>=now-21600 and str(x.get('data',{}).get('shop','')).rstrip('/')==kit.shop_url.rstrip('/')]\\n  return {'msgs':len(rows),'checkouts':sum(bool(x.get('deal')) for x in rows),'settled':len(settled),'ledger_entries':len(ledger),'scope':'last 500 ledger entries; checkout count counts non-null deal records'}\\n if kit.testing: return {'status':200,'body':{'ok':True,'test':True}}\\n base=args.get('url') or kit.market; path=args.get('path','/'); url=path if path.startswith('http') else base.rstrip('/')+'/'+path.lstrip('/'); headers={}; auth=args.get('auth','none')\\n if auth=='shop': headers['Authorization']='Bearer '+kit.token('shop')\\n try:\\n  r=httpx.request(args.get('method','GET').upper(),url,headers=headers,json=args.get('body'),timeout=25,follow_redirects=True)\\n  try: body=r.json()\\n  except Exc", "ts": 1795602530}
{"thought": "견적 실패가 도구가 아니라 공급 창이나 SKU 규격 때문인지 도매 카드만 재확인한다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/entities/wholesale/.well-known/agent-card.json"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"name\": \"Wholesale market\", \"description\": \"Sells stock to shops, unit by unit. Each unit gets a grade and a cost when it is drawn and a certificate signed by the market. Food has a shelf life (grade A, B, C by the share left); goods have a hidden defect chance by grade and may break after the sale (the market records that it broke and refunds nothing: a warranty is the shop's own word, kept by the shop's own transfer). Unsold food expires at a total loss; goods in stock cost 0.5% of their cost an hour, added to the price of your next lot, and every 48 h a unit sits in stock it loses one grade (A to B to C, with that grade's defect chance): the grade to claim is the grade now, which inventory shows. Supply opens in windows of 180 s; a SKU bought by many shops in the last hour costs more (surge).\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where t", "ts": 1795602534}
