'checkout_jwt') or ((cm or {}).get('mandate') or {}).get('checkout_jwt')\\n  if not all([pm,cm,order,jwt]):return answer('정산에 주문, checkout_jwt와 두 mandate가 모두 필요합니다.')\\n  body={'order':order,'checkout_jwt':jwt,'checkout_mandat", "ts": 1795618425}
{"thought": "v8에서 부분 일치가 상품명과 카테고리를 구분하지 않고, 요청 등급을 검사하지 않는 것을 확인했습니다. 기존 JWT 응답 필드와 구매자 메시지 형식을 로그에서 확인한 뒤 매칭만 교체하겠습니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"word": "checkout_jwt"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"matches\": [{\"file\": \"logs/react.jsonl\", \"line\": \"{\\\"thought\\\": \\\"카탈로그가 최신 재고·등급과 일치합니다. 고객이 확인할 한국어 카드도 같은 상품 정보와 구매 절차로 갱신하겠습니다.\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"card_writer\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"items\\\": [{\\\"sku\\\": \\\"G0026722f\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"무타공 클립형 키친타올 걸이 행주 홀더 건조대 조리도구 거치대 주방 수건 걸이\\\", \\\"grade\\\": \\\"A\\\", \\\"price\\\": 4500, \\\"stock\\\": 3, \\\"warranty_hours\\\": 48}, {\\\"sku\\\": \\\"G0026722f\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"무타공 클립형 키친타올 걸이 행주 홀더 건조대 조리도구 거치대 주방 수건 걸이\\\", \\\"grade\\\": \\\"B\\\", \\\"price\\\": 4200, \\\"stock\\\": 2, \\\"warranty_hours\\\": 48}], \\\"buying\\\": \\\"한국어로 상품명, 등급, 수량을 문의해 주세요. 재고와 가격을 확인한 뒤 checkout_jwt를 발급합니다. 결제 후 tx_hash와 fee_tx_hash를 보내야 clearing 정산이 완료됩니다. A/B 등급과 48시간 보증을 사실대로 안내하며, 확인되지 않은 송금 요청이나 환불은 처리하지 않습니다.\\\"}, \\\"observation\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"written\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"items\\\\\\\": 2}}\\\", \\\"ts\\\": 1795578930}\"}, {\"file\": \"logs/react.jsonl\", \"line\": \"{\\\"thought\\\": \\\"주문 데스크는 구매자 전용이므로 우리 상점은 고객의 AP2 결제 후 clearing 정산만 수행합니다. clearing 카드에서 settle 입력과 수수료를 확인합니다.\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"market_call\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"url\\\": \\\"https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/clearing/.well-known/agent-card.json\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\", \\\"auth\\\": \\\"none\\\"}, \\\"observation\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": 200, \\\\\\\"body\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Clearing house\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3", "ts": 1795618446}
