{"thought": "기존 코드 조회에서 결제서 생성부가 잘렸으므로, 잘못된 결제서 발급을 고치는 데 필요한 clearing 계약만 확인한다. 나머지 카드는 다시 읽지 않는다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/entities/clearing/.well-known/agent-card.json"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"name\": \"Clearing house\", \"description\": \"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo ", "ts": 1795636535}
{"thought": "복수 품목 문의에는 품목별 실재고를 안내하고, 확인되지 않은 대체품 결제서는 발급하지 않겠다. 배포 전에 재고 응답의 단위·등급·기한 필드를 확인한다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "stock_and_price"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: stock_and_price\\ndescription: 실재고 SKU·현재 등급별 판매 목록을 공시한다. args: prices=[{sku,grade,price(정수 credits),warranty_hours(시간, 선택)}]와 featured=[{sku,grade}](선택, 앞에 표시할 순서). 생략하면 기존 가격·보증·표시 순서를 유지하고 새 등급은 정가·보증 0시간으로 추가한다. catalog_path(선택, 기본 public/catalog.json), inventory(테스트 전용). 예 {ok:true,count:2,items:[{sku:'G159be1f8',grade:'A',price:2990,units:['u-…']}]}\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/catalog.json, public/catalog.json.next, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  timeout: 30\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 6\\nreplaces: stock_and_price@5\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import json,os,math,re,httpx\\n\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n try:\\n  p=args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json')\\n  if kit.testing and not os.path.abspath(p).startswith(os.path.abspath('tmp/test')+os.sep):\\n   raise ValueError('test catalog path must be inside tmp/test')\\n  try:\\n   with open(p,encoding='utf8') as f: old=json.load(f)['items']\\n  except FileNotFoundError: old=[]\\n  specs={(x['sku'],x['grade']):{k:x[k] for k in ('price','warranty_hours') if k in x} for x in old}\\n  for x in args.get('prices',[]):\\n   specs.setdefault((x['sku'],x['grade']),{}).update({k:x[k] for k in ('price','warranty_hours') if k in x})\\n  if kit.testing: units=args['inventory']\\n  else:\\n   r=httpx.get(kit.market.rstrip('/')+'/api/inventory',headers={'Authorization':'Bearer '+kit.token('shop')},timeout=12)\\n   r.raise_for_status(); units=r.json()['units']\\n  groups={}\\n  for u in units:\\n   key=(u.get('sku'),u.get('grade'))\\n   if all(key) and u.get('unit'): groups.setdefault(key,[]).append(u)\\n  priority={}\\n  for x in args.get('featured',[])+old:\\n   key=(x['sku'],x['grade']); priority.setdefault(key,len(priority))\\n  out=[]\\n  for key in sorted(groups,key=lambda k:priority.get(k,len(priority))):\\n   us=groups[key]\\n   us.sort(key=lambda u:(u.get('expires_at') or float('inf'),u.get('supplied_at') or 0)); spec=specs.get(key,{})\\n   floor=max(math.ceil((int(u['cost'])+210)*", "ts": 1795636555}
