{"thought": "최근 6시간의 체크아웃 두 건은 모두 문의한 상품과 달랐습니다. 기존 정산·재고 검증은 보존하고 상품 식별과 체크아웃 발급 조건만 손보겠습니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "a2a_handler"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: a2a_handler\\ndescription: 고객 A2A 문의 자동응답(v9). 이벤트 args {text,data,claimed_from,context_id,task_id}와 선택 경로 catalog_path(기본 public/catalog.json), reservations_path, customers_path, holds_path. 2자+ 단어로 상품명·카테고리 검색(조사 1자 제거 허용), 'A등급'/'B급' 또는 data.grade로 등급 지정 시 그 등급만 판매하고 없으면 보유 등급 안내(checkout 없음). 실재고 unit 보류 후 shop 서명 checkout_jwt(data: checkout_jwt, unit, sku, grade, price). mandates 수신 시 /api/settle 전달(503 재전송). 모든 메시지를 customers.jsonl에 기록.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [customers.jsonl, public/reservations.jsonl, holds.json, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\n  timeout: 20\\n  handles: [a2a]\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 9\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@8\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import os,json,time,re,uuid\\nimport httpx\\n\\ndef read(p,d):\\n try:\\n  with open(p,encoding='utf8') as f:return json.load(f)\\n except Exception:return d\\n\\ndef lines(p):\\n out=[]\\n try:\\n  with open(p,encoding='utf8') as f:\\n   for x in f:\\n    if x.strip():\\n     try:out.append(json.loads(x))\\n     except Exception:pass\\n except Exception:pass\\n return out\\n\\ndef save(p,x):\\n os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(p) or '.',exist_ok=True)\\n with open(p,'w',encoding='utf8') as f:json.dump(x,f,ensure_ascii=False)\\n\\ndef kst(ts):\\n try:return time.strftime('%m월 %d일 %H시',time.gmtime(float(ts)+9*3600))+'(KST)'\\n except Exception:return str(ts)\\n\\nSTOP={'있나요','있습니까','주세요','얼마','가격','재고','상품','등급','구매','원해요','알려주세요','checkout','credits','안녕하세요'}\\n\\ndef want_grade(text,data):\\n g=str(data.get('grade') or '').upper()\\n if g in ('A','B','C'):return g\\n m=re.search(r'(?<![A-Za-z])([ABCabc])\\\\s*(등급|급)',text)\\n return m.group(1).upper() if m else None\\n\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n now=time.time(); text=args.get('text') or ''; data=args.get('data') or {}\\n if not isinstance(data,dict):data={}\\n ctx=args.get('context_id') or ''; who=args.get('claimed_from')\\n cp=args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json'); rp=args.get('reservations_path','public/reserv", "ts": 1795647654}
{"thought": "기존 도구 출력이 재고 선택 직전에서 잘렸습니다. 이전 서명·예약 테스트 기록에서 task와 예약 필드의 사용법을 확인한 뒤 같은 도구를 교체하겠습니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"word": "checkout_jwt", "paths": ["logs/react.jsonl"]}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"matches\": [{\"file\": \"logs/react.jsonl\", \"line\": \"{\\\"thought\\\": \\\"대기 메시지는 없다. 시간 점검이 기한을 넘겼고 마지막 기록의 실패 카운트와 현재 카운트는 같다. 이번에는 확인된 상품·등급 오매칭만 고치기 위해 기존 핸들러와 테스트를 확인한다.\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"read_tool\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"name\\\": \\\"a2a_handler\\\"}, \\\"observation\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"permission.yml\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"name: a2a_handler\\\\\\\\ndescription: 고객 A2A 문의를 상품 검색·실재고 보류·shop 서명 checkout 및 지급 mandates 정산으로 처리한다. 이벤트 args와 선택적 catalog_path,reservations_path,customers_path,holds_path를 받는다.\\\\\\\\npermission:\\\\\\\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\\\\\\\n  write: [customers.jsonl, public/reservations.jsonl, holds.json, tmp/test/]\\\\\\\\n  identity: [shop]\\\\\\\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\\\\\\\n  timeout: 20\\\\\\\\n  handles: [a2a]\\\\\\\\nlogic: logic.py\\\\\\\\ntest: test.py\\\\\\\\nversion: 8\\\\\\\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@7\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"logic.py\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"import os,json,time,re,uuid\\\\\\\\nimport httpx\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\ndef read(p,d):\\\\\\\\n try:\\\\\\\\n  with open(p,encoding='utf8') as f:return json.load(f)\\\\\\\\n except Exception:return d\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\ndef lines(p):\\\\\\\\n try:\\\\\\\\n  with open(p,encoding='utf8') as f:return [json.loads(x) for x in f if x.strip()]\\\\\\\\n except Exception:return []\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\ndef save(p,x):\\\\\\\\n os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(p) or '.',exist_ok=True)\\\\\\\\n with open(p,'w',encoding='utf8') as f:json.dump(x,f,ensure_ascii=False)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\ndef run(args,kit):\\\\\\\\n now=time.time(); text=args.get('text') or ''; data=args.get('data') or {}; ctx=args.get('context_id') or ''; who=args.get('claimed_from'); cp=args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json'); rp=args.get('reservations_path','public/reservations.jsonl'); lp=args.get('customers_path','customers.jsonl'); hp=args.get('holds_path','holds.json')\\\\\\\\n def answer(reply,state='input_required',out=None,deal=None):\\\\\\\\n  os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(lp) or '.',exist_ok=True)\\\\\\\\n  with open(lp,'a',encoding='utf8') as f:f.write(json.dumps({'context_id':ctx,'claimed_from':who,'ts':now,'them':text,'you':reply,'deal':deal},ensure_ascii=False)+'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n')\\\\\\\\n  r={'reply':repl", "ts": 1795647737}
