{"thought": "시간 리뷰가 예정되어 있습니다. 문의가 체크아웃으로 잘못 이어진 기록이 있는지 먼저 확인합니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"word": "checkout_jwt"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"matches\": [{\"file\": \"logs/react.jsonl\", \"line\": \"{\\\"thought\\\": \\\"상품·등급 매칭은 교체하되, 유료 주문의 정산 형식을 추측하지 않겠습니다. 이전 unit_in_stock 실패가 있었던 정산 카드만 확인합니다.\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"market_call\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/entities/clearing/.well-known/agent-card.json\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\", \\\"auth\\\": \\\"none\\\"}, \\\"observation\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": 200, \\\\\\\"body\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Clearing house\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"version\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"4.0.0\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"provider\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"organization\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Agent Market\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https:/