{"thought": "The inventory confirms current grades can differ from what the catalog advertised. I’ll keep live inventory as the authority and check how the catalog stores unit IDs, prices, and expiry.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "stock_and_price"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: stock_and_price\\ndescription: 실재고 SKU·현재 등급별 판매 목록을 공시한다. args: prices=[{sku,grade,price(정수 credits),warranty_hours(시간, 선택)}]와 featured=[{sku,grade}](선택, 앞에 표시할 순서). 생략하면 기존 가격·보증·표시 순서를 유지하고 새 등급은 정가·보증 0시간으로 추가한다. catalog_path(선택, 기본 public/catalog.json), inventory(테스트 전용). 예 {ok:true,count:2,items:[{sku:'G159be1f8',grade:'A',price:2990,units:['u-…']}]}\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/catalog.json, public/catalog.json.next, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  timeout: 30\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 6\\nreplaces: stock_and_price@5\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import json,os,math,re,httpx\\n\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n try:\\n  p=args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json')\\n  if kit.testing and not os.path.abspath(p).startswith(os.path.abspath('tmp/test')+os.sep):\\n   raise ValueError('test catalog path must be inside tmp/test')\\n  try:\\n   with open(p,encoding='utf8') as f: old=json.load(f)['items']\\n  except FileNotFoundError: old=[]\\n  specs={(x['sku'],x['grade']):{k:x[k] for k in ('price','warranty_hours') if k in x} for x in old}\\n  for x in args.get('prices',[]):\\n   specs.setdefault((x['sku'],x['grade']),{}).update({k:x[k] for k in ('price','warranty_hours') if k in x})\\n  if kit.testing: units=args['inventory']\\n  else:\\n   r=httpx.get(kit.market.rstrip('/')+'/api/inventory',headers={'Authorization':'Bearer '+kit.token('shop')},timeout=12)\\n   r.raise_for_status(); units=r.json()['units']\\n  groups={}\\n  for u in units:\\n   key=(u.get('sku'),u.get('grade'))\\n   if all(key) and u.get('unit'): groups.setdefault(key,[]).append(u)\\n  priority={}\\n  for x in args.get('featured',[])+old:\\n   key=(x['sku'],x['grade']); priority.setdefault(key,len(priority))\\n  out=[]\\n  for key in sorted(groups,key=lambda k:priority.get(k,len(priority))):\\n   us=groups[key]\\n   us.sort(key=lambda u:(u.get('expires_at') or float('inf'),u.get('supplied_at') or 0)); spec=specs.get(key,{})\\n   floor=max(math.ceil((int(u['cost'])+210)*", "ts": 1795650407}
