{"thought": "앱 응답이 없어 이번 실행에는 다시 호출하지 않고 신규 송금을 보류합니다. 기존 핸들러를 읽어 정산과 예약 계약을 유지하겠습니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "a2a_handler"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: a2a_handler\\ndescription: 고객 A2A 문의 자동응답(v9). 이벤트 args {text,data,claimed_from,context_id,task_id}와 선택 경로 catalog_path(기본 public/catalog.json), reservations_path, customers_path, holds_path. 2자+ 단어로 상품명·카테고리 검색(조사 1자 제거 허용), 'A등급'/'B급' 또는 data.grade로 등급 지정 시 그 등급만 판매하고 없으면 보유 등급 안내(checkout 없음). 실재고 unit 보류 후 shop 서명 checkout_jwt(data: checkout_jwt, unit, sku, grade, price). mandates 수신 시 /api/settle 전달(503 재전송). 모든 메시지를 customers.jsonl에 기록.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [customers.jsonl, public/reservations.jsonl, holds.json, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\n  timeout: 20\\n  handles: [a2a]\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 9\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@8\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import os,json,time,re,uuid\\nimport httpx\\n\\ndef read(p,d):\\n try:\\n  with open(p,encoding='utf8') as f:return json.load(f)\\n except Exception:return d\\n\\ndef lines(p):\\n out=[]\\n try:\\n  with open(p,encoding='utf8') as f:\\n   for x in f:\\n    if x.strip():\\n     try:out.append(json.loads(x))\\n     except Exception:pass\\n except Exception:pass\\n return out\\n\\ndef save(p,x):\\n os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(p) or '.',exist_ok=True)\\n with open(p,'w',encoding='utf8') as f:json.dump(x,f,ensure_ascii=False)\\n\\ndef kst(ts):\\n try:return time.strftime('%m월 %d일 %H시',time.gmtime(float(ts)+9*3600))+'(KST)'\\n except Exception:return str(ts)\\n\\nSTOP={'있나요','있습니까','주세요','얼마','가격','재고','상품','등급','구매','원해요','알려주세요','checkout','credits','안녕하세요'}\\n\\ndef want_grade(text,data):\\n g=str(data.get('grade') or '').upper()\\n if g in ('A','B','C'):return g\\n m=re.search(r'(?<![A-Za-z])([ABCabc])\\\\s*(등급|급)',text)\\n return m.group(1).upper() if m else None\\n\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n now=time.time(); text=args.get('text') or ''; data=args.get('data') or {}\\n if not isinstance(data,dict):data={}\\n ctx=args.get('context_id') or ''; who=args.get('claimed_from')\\n cp=args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json'); rp=args.get('reservations_path','public/reserv", "ts": 1795658515}
{"thought": "기존 코드의 정산 전달 방식과 JWT 필수 필드는 유지합니다. 보유 등급과 구매 의사를 각각 확인하고, 서명 전에 실재고를 다시 조회하도록 고치겠습니다.", "action": "recall", "args": {"word": "checkout_mandate"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"matches\": [{\"file\": \"logs/react.jsonl\", \"line\": \"{\\\"thought\\\": \\\"현재 마을에는 80명이 방문 희망하고 100명가량이 체류 중입니다. 주문·청산·도매·게시판·점수판·은행 카드와 재고를 순서대로 확인하겠습니다.\\\", \\\"action\\\": \\\"market_call\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"url\\\": \\\"https://market.ourolabs.ai\\\", \\\"path\\\": \\\"/entities/clearing/.well-known/agent-card.json\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\", \\\"auth\\\": \\\"none\\\"}, \\\"observation\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": true, \\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": 200, \\\\\\\"body\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Clearing house\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"version\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"4.0.0\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"provider\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"organization\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Agent Market\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://market.ourolabs.ai\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"supportedInterfaces\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://market.ourolabs.ai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"protocolBinding\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"MARKET-REST\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"protocolVersion\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"4\\\\\\\"}], \\\\\\\"capabilities\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"streaming\\\\\\\": false, \\\\\\\"pushNotifications\\\\\\\": false, \\\\\\\"e", "ts": 1795658643}
{"thought": "문의 집계가 새 결제서도 셀 수 있도록 기존 로그 형식을 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "market_call"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: market_call\\ndescription: 시장 REST·재고·판매 집계. HTTP: {path:'/api/restock',method:'GET'(기본) 또는 'POST',auth:'none'(기본) 또는 'shop',body:JSON 선택,url:동일 시장 origin URL 선택}; 공급 402/429는 정상 결과. {mode:'inventory',skus:['G02f9f99c']}(최대 15개, 생략 시 최대 30개 SKU 요약): balance(credits), restock(Unix 초), lots:[{sku,grade,qty,max_cost,min_cost,first_expiry,units:[{unit,cost,expires_at,supplied_at}]}]. {mode:'metrics',now:1795629729,customers_path:'customers.jsonl'}(둘 다 선택): msgs/checkouts/settled(6h), hour, top_sales(등급별 중앙가 credits), 최근 메시지, 원장 표본 범위. {mode:'discovery',skus:['G02f9f99c']}(선택): 시장 등록 여부와 해당 SKU 판매점 수. 실패는 {ok:false,error:'…'\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 30\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 11\\nreplaces: market_call@10\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import httpx,json,time,re,statistics\\nfrom urllib.parse import urlsplit,urljoin\\nfrom collections import defaultdict,Counter\\n\\ndef num(v): return isinstance(v,(int,float)) and not isinstance(v,bool)\\ndef norm(v): return str(v or '').rstrip('/').removesuffix('/.well-known/agent-card.json').lower()\\ndef bad(msg): return {'ok':False,'error':str(msg)[:450]}\\ndef pick_skus(args):\\n skus=args.get('skus',[])\\n if not isinstance(skus,list) or len(skus)>15 or any(not isinstance(s,str) for s in skus): raise ValueError('skus: SKU 문자열 최대 15개')\\n return skus\\n\\ndef inventory(args,body):\\n skus=pick_skus(args)\\n if not isinstance(body,dict) or not num(body.get('balance')) or not isinstance(body.get('units'),list): return bad('inventory balance/units 형식 오류')\\n groups=defaultdict(list)\\n for u in body['units']:\\n  if not isinstance(u,dict) or not u.get('sku') or not u.get('grade') or not u.get('unit') or not num(u.get('cost')): return bad('inventory unit/sku/grade/cost 형식 오류')\\n  if not skus or u['sku'] in skus: groups[(u['sku'],u['grade'])].append({k:u.get(k) for k in ('unit','cost','supplied_at','expires_at')})\\n allowed=set(list(dict.fromkeys(k[0] for k in", "ts": 1795658654}
