{"thought": "판매 가능 품목의 고원가 묶음 처리와 가격 동작을 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "stock_and_price"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: stock_and_price\\ndescription: 실재고와 원장 표본으로 무손실 가격을 계산해 public/catalog.json 게시. mode=preview는 파일을 쓰지 않습니다. 테스트는 tmp/test 경로와 inventory, ledger_fixture를 사용합니다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/catalog.json, public/catalog.json.next, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 35\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 7\\nreplaces: stock_and_price@6\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import json,math,os,re,time,statistics\\nfrom collections import defaultdict\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport httpx\\n\\ndef run(args,kit):\\n try:\\n  p=Path(args.get('catalog_path','public/catalog.json'))\\n  if kit.testing and not str(p.resolve()).startswith(str(Path('tmp/test').resolve())+os.sep):raise ValueError('test path must be tmp/test')\\n  if not kit.testing and str(p)!='public/catalog.json':raise ValueError('invalid catalog path')\\n  try:old=json.loads(p.read_text(encoding='utf8')).get('items',[])\\n  except FileNotFoundError:old=[]\\n  if kit.testing:units=args['inventory'];ledger=args['ledger_fixture'];now=args.get('now',time.time())\\n  else:\\n   headers={'Authorization':'Bearer '+kit.token('shop')};r=httpx.get(kit.market.rstrip('/')+'/api/inventory',headers=headers,timeout=12);r.raise_for_status();units=r.json()['units']\\n   r=httpx.get(kit.market.rstrip('/')+'/api/ledger?after=-500',timeout=12);r.raise_for_status();ledger=r.json();now=time.time()\\n  if isinstance(ledger,dict):ledger=ledger.get('entries',ledger.get('ledger',[]))\\n  if not isinstance(ledger,list) or not isinstance(units,list):raise ValueError('inventory/ledger invalid')\\n  sales=defaultdict(list)\\n  for e in ledger:\\n   if e.get('kind')!='settle' or e.get('round',4)!=4:continue\\n   d=e.get('data') or {};sku=d.get('sku') or d.get('item');grade=d.get('grade');price=d.get('amount',d.get('price'))\\n   if isinstance(sku,str) and grade in ('A','B','C') and isinstance(price,(int,float)) and price>0:sales[(sku,grade)].append(price)\\n  groups=defaultdict(list)\\n  for u i", "ts": 1795666396}
{"thought": "같은 품목·등급을 나눠 진열할 때 결제서가 실제 보유 유닛과 가격을 정확히 묶는지 확인합니다.", "action": "read_tool", "args": {"name": "a2a_handler"}, "observation": "{\"permission.yml\": \"name: a2a_handler\\ndescription: 고객 메시지의 품목별 구매 결제서 최대 3개와 예약·정산 처리를 수행합니다. 테스트에서 catalog_path, holds_path, customers_path, reservations_path를 tmp/test/로 지정하며 inventory_fixture를 사용할 수 있습니다.\\npermission:\\n  network: [market.ourolabs.ai]\\n  write: [public/reservations.jsonl, customers.jsonl, holds.json, tmp/test/]\\n  identity: [shop]\\n  wallet: [sign_jwt]\\n  pay_limit: 0\\n  timeout: 35\\n  handles: [a2a]\\nlogic: logic.py\\ntest: test.py\\nversion: 11\\nreplaces: a2a_handler@10\\n\", \"logic.py\": \"import datetime,fcntl,json,math,os,re,time,uuid\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport httpx\\n\\nNOUNS={'냉장고':['냉장고'],'우유':['우유'],'요거트':['요거트','요구르트'],'샴푸':['샴푸'],'치약':['치약'],'두부':['두부'],'계란':['계란','달걀','유정란'],'둥굴레차':['둥굴레차'],'보리차':['보리차'],'녹차':['녹차'],'홍차':['홍차'],'차':['둥굴레차','보리차','녹차','홍차','차'], '총각김치':['총각김치','알타리김치'],'김치':['김치'],'취나물':['취나물'],'시금치':['시금치'],'쌈채소':['쌈채소'],'콩나물':['콩나물'],'쌀':['쌀','백미'],'고등어':['고등어'],'사과':['사과'],'생수':['생수'],'고구마':['고구마'],'과자':['과자'],'타올':['키친타올','타올'],'커피':['커피']}\\nORDER=sorted(NOUNS,key=len,reverse=True)\\ndef tm(v):\\n try:\\n  if not v:return 0\\n  return float(v)\\n except (ValueError,TypeError):\\n  try:return datetime.datetime.fromisoformat(str(v).replace('Z','+00:00')).timestamp()\\n  except Exception:return 0\\ndef checked_path(a,k,default,testing):\\n p=Path(a.get(k,default))\\n if testing:\\n  if p.is_absolute() or '..' in p.parts or p.parts[:2]!=('tmp','test'):raise ValueError('invalid test path')\\n elif str(p)!=default:raise ValueError('invalid path')\\n return p\\ndef load(p,default):\\n try:return json.loads(p.read_text(encoding='utf8'))\\n except FileNotFoundError:return default\\ndef api(kit,path,body=None):\\n return httpx.request('POST' if body is not None else 'GET',kit.market.rstrip('/')+path,headers={'Authorization':'Bearer '+kit.token('shop')},json=body,timeout=8)\\ndef say(s,data=None,state='input_required'):\\n r={'reply':s,'state':state}\\n if data is not None:r['data']=data\\n return r\\ndef settled(x):\\n if not isinstance(x,dict):ret", "ts": 1795666398}
